</div></div></div><div class="fe-block fe-block-dc7ff2d848b32d4ff5c2"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e7686af-5741-42b1-8e29-ad20492d91d5_911/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e7686af-5741-42b1-8e29-ad20492d91d5_911/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="dc7ff2d848b32d4ff5c2" id="block-dc7ff2d848b32d4ff5c2"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">Pathways Within is more than a business. It is a living, breathing story built from resilience, community, curiosity, and the belief that even the hardest chapters can lead somewhere meaningful.</span></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">What started as one person’s healing journey has grown into a collaborative mental health and wellness organization for real people living real, wonderfully complicated lives.</span></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">We know growth rarely follows a neat little timeline. It twists, turns, pauses, doubles back, and occasionally asks you to sit down and catch your breath.</span></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">That is not failure. That is being human.</span></p></div>


  
