</style><div class="fluid-engine fe-6a75da610e9b395f88903eec"><div class="fe-block fe-block-72103381ff213a14241f"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e7686af-5741-42b1-8e29-ad20492d91d5_911/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e7686af-5741-42b1-8e29-ad20492d91d5_911/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="72103381ff213a14241f" id="block-72103381ff213a14241f"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">✓ </span><strong>The whole picture</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Mental, physical, and emotional well-being are connected—whether or not they coordinate their calendars.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">✓ </span><strong>Your path, your pace</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">There is no universal formula, perfect timeline, or gold star for healing the fastest.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">✓ </span><strong>Better together</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Care works best when clients, providers, and support teams communicate and collaborate.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">✓ </span><strong>Community matters</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Growth is personal, but that does not mean you have to do it alone.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Pathways Within continues to evolve alongside the people and communities we serve. Each new service, provider, and location is added with intention—not just because we can, but because it creates another meaningful way to help people feel seen, supported, and able to move forward.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">✓ </span><strong>Take what you need. Leave what you do not.</strong></p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">The path does not have to be straight to be taking you somewhere.</p></div>


  
