        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Pathways Within is a collaborative mental health and wellness organization for the whole person, not just the one concern that brought you through the door.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-2"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-2"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">What does “whole-person care” mean?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-2"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-2"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">It means we recognize that mental health, physical health, relationships, stress, lifestyle, and daily responsibilities are all part of the same life. We look at the broader picture and help you explore the support that may be most useful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-3"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-3"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Do I need to know exactly what kind of support I need?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-3"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-3"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">No, and honestly, most people do not. You may know that something feels off, heavy, stuck, or simply ready to change. Our Welcome Team can help you sort through the options and find a place to begin.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-4"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-4"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">What services does Pathways Within offer?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-4"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-4"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Services may include individual, couples, family, and group therapy, medication management, performance and wellness coaching, acupuncture, massage, nutrition, esthetic services, and other wellness offerings. Availability varies by location, because apparently one building cannot contain all of us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-5"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-5"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Do I have to use more than one service?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-5"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-5"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Not at all. Some clients work with one provider, while others build a mix of services over time. Take what feels helpful. Leave what does not. Your care should fit you not the other way around.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-6"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-6"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Can my providers communicate with one another?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-6"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-6"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Yes, when it is helpful and with your permission. Members of your care team will collaborate to create a more connected healing experience, while your privacy, comfort, and consent stay at the center of the process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-7"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-7"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Is Pathways Within only for people in crisis?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-7"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-7"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Definitely not. People come to us during hard seasons, but also for personal growth, stronger relationships, stress support, physical well-being, performance goals, or simply because life could use a tune-up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-8"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-8"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Do you accept insurance?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </h4>
      <div
        class="accordion-item__dropdown"
        id="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-8"
        role="region"
        aria-labelledby="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-8"
      >
        <div
          class="
            accordion-item__description
            
            
            
          "
          data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-description
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Insurance participation varies by provider, service, and individual plan. Some mental health, medication management, acupuncture, and other services may be covered. Our Welcome team can help explain the options based on your coverage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        <div data-sqsp-accordion-block-divider class="accordion-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      

    </li>
  
    <li class="accordion-item" >

      
        
      

      <h4
        class="
          accordion-item__title-wrapper
          
          
          
        "
        data-sqsp-accordion-block-item-title
      >
        <button
          id="button-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-9"
          class="accordion-item__click-target"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="dropdown-abf2de598dbcc7bcbb8b-9"
        >
          <span class="accordion-item__title">Where are services available?</span>
          <div class="accordion-icon-container" aria-hidden="true">
            
              <div class="plus">
                <div class="plus__horizontal-line"></div>
                <div class="plus__vertical-line"></div>
              </div>
            
