        <h2
          class="list-item-content__title"
          style="max-width: 100%;"
        >Rachel Lessard, LCSW-R</h2>
      

      
        <div class="list-item-content__description
          
          "
          style="
            margin-top: 4%;
            max-width: 100%;
          "
        >
          <p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>FOUNDER OF PATHWAYS WITHIN</strong></p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Rachel is a therapist, lifelong listener, and the founder of Pathways Within.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">She sets the vision, protects the culture, and keeps asking how Pathways can make care feel more connected, more human, and more useful in real life.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">For the behind-the-scenes version of her journey, follow The Wisdom of Wellness on Substack at @the.wisdom.of.wellness.</p>
        </div>
      

    </div>
  

  
