        <h2
          class="list-item-content__title"
          style="max-width: 100%;"
        >Ksusha Cascio, LCSW</h2>
      

      
        <div class="list-item-content__description
          
          "
          style="
            margin-top: 4%;
            max-width: 100%;
          "
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER</strong></p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Ksusha is the person who helps turn big ideas into clear plans, strong systems, and an organization that actually knows where the metaphorical keys are.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">With a passion for developing the clinicians in the practice, her thoughtful, judgment-free approach keeps teams connected, operations moving, and growth grounded in the experience of the people doing the work so they can deliver the best level of patient care.</p>
        </div>
      

    </div>
  

  
