            margin-top: 4%;
            max-width: 100%;
          "
        >
          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>CLINICAL DIRECTOR, NASSAU</strong></p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Joe brings a relational, practical lens to clinical leadership and a strong belief that no one should have to navigate life’s challenges alone.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Drawing from his work with adolescents, adults, families, and relationships, he supports the Nassau clinical team in delivering care that is compassionate, approachable, and rooted in real-world needs.</p>
