          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>CLINICAL DIRECTOR, SUFFOLK</strong></p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Lee brings a broad, adaptable clinical perspective to his leadership of the Suffolk team.</p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">He encourages curiosity, inclusivity, and flexibility, helping clinicians expand their skills while keeping treatment centered on the person in front of them, not a one-size-fits-all playbook.</p>
