  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Better Together </h2><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Rachel has the big ideas. Ksusha builds the structure around it. Joe brings a deeply relational and practical lens to clinical leadership, while Lee champions adaptability, individuality, and continued learning.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">They do not lead in separate lanes. They collaborate across locations, disciplines, and decisions to make sure Pathways Within stays connected in how it grows, how it supports its team, and how it cares for people. Different strengths. Shared direction. Much better together – even better with coffee!</p></div>


  
